26658	26793	When Croatia joined the EU in July 2013, the Health/Consumer Protection split made during Bulgaria's accession in 2007 was replicated.

26793	26863	Dalli was forced to resign in October 2012 due to a lobbying frame-up.
26864	26895	His replacement is Tonio Borg.

